    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the PR! It is now part of the `main`. I made the following adjustments:\r\n\r\n- Added 'Session.vim' file to '.gitignore'. I personally don't use it, but it is still might be relevant. Especially since 'mini.sessions' supports it by default.\r\n- Adjusted injection documentation to use single quotes (`'`) for file paths (for consistency with other documentation) and increased indent of the code block (so that it is shown as part of the bullet point and not as another list entry).",
